# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your real .env file to version control.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# How to get a free Maps Demo Key for prototyping (no billing setup required):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no credit card requested).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click the button to generate and reveal your demo key.
# 5. Copy .env.example to .env and replace your_google_maps_api_key_here with your key.
#
# Note: The Maps Demo Key has a daily quota limit and is for prototyping only.
# For production deployments, create and restrict an API key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), and Routes API.
